# Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored. swp is an executable, so the
# exact dependency versions it was built and tested against belong in the repo
# — same call termdown makes. (It has no dependencies today, so the file does
# not exist yet; this is here so adding one does the right thing by default.)

